Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,How do you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.47,0:00:01.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop a runaway
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.29,0:00:01.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,train at the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.82,0:00:02.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,end of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.05,0:00:02.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:03.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hitting a solid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:04.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,wall would wreck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.39,0:00:05.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,it, so this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:06.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,buffer stop is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,built to slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:08.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's clamped to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:08.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,the rails by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:10.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel shoes, bolted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:10.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.17,0:00:11.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,When a train
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.79,0:00:12.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,hits, the stop's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:13.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,hydraulic buffers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.67,0:00:14.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,squash first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:15.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:16.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop gets shoved
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:17.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,along the rails,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:18.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the friction
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:19.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,turns the train's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:20.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,speed into heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:21.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,A six-car train
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:22.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,at fifteen miles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:23.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,an hour stops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:23.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,in about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:24.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,sixty feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:25.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's gentler than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:26.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,slamming on the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:26.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,brakes in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:27.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:28.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:28.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,me driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:29.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:31.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, crews loosen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:32.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,the bolts, push
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:33.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,it back, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:34.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,tighten them again.
